@startuml State_Transaction_Document
title State Machine — Inventory Transaction Document (Pola Umum Draft ke Posted)

' OBJECT  : SMO-00 pola umum; spesialisasi ada pada SM-01 Inbound, SM-02 Outbound, SM-03 Transfer
' UC      : UC-15, UC-16, UC-17, UC-18, UC-19, UC-20
' FR      : FR-IN-001..006, FR-OUT-001..006, FR-TRF-001..005, FR-AUD-001, FR-AUD-004
' RULE    : RULE-003, RULE-004, RULE-010, RULE-011, RULE-012, RULE-018, RULE-024, RULE-025, RULE-027
' DECISION: D-B07 Proposed, D-B15 Proposed, D-T06 Proposed
' CATATAN : Topologi status identik; guard dan action berbeda per jenis transaksi.
'           Validated bukan state tersimpan. Cancelled tidak dimodelkan (D-B15 Proposed).

state "Draft" as Draft
state "Posted" as Posted

[*] --> Draft : Create [nomor unik RULE-024, master aktif] / simpan header dan baris, saldo tidak diubah

Draft --> Draft : Revise [masih Draft] / simpan ulang, saldo tidak diubah

Draft --> Posted : Post [permission RULE-011, validasi RULE lulus, masih Draft] / transaksi atomik, movement, audit, COMMIT

Draft --> Draft : Post gagal [validasi gagal atau error] / ROLLBACK, saldo dan status tetap

Posted --> Posted : Edit/Hapus [RULE-012] / tolak, dokumen utuh

Posted --> [*]

note right of Draft
  RULE-010: Draft tidak mengubah saldo.
  Tidak ada state Validated atau Cancelled.
end note

note right of Posted
  RULE-012: dokumen immutable.
  Koreksi lewat dokumen terpisah, D-B08 Proposed.
end note

@enduml
